text	dateSequentialDesignationNoteItemDefText	alvin	{"name": "text", "children": [{"name": "recordInfo", "children": [{"name": "id", "value": "dateSequentialDesignationNoteItemDefText"}, {"name": "type", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "recordType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "text"}]}, {"name": "dataDivider", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "system"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "alvin"}]}, {"name": "validationType", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "validationType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "alvinText"}]}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}, {"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2018-07-23T12:21:31.585000Z"}], "repeatId": "0"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}, {"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2023-03-03T14:51:59.209182Z"}], "repeatId": "1"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "151515"}]}, {"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2024-01-04T10:08:27.018599Z"}], "repeatId": "2"}, {"name": "createdBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}, {"name": "tsCreated", "value": "2018-07-23T12:21:31.585000Z"}]}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Start-/slutdatum för en artikel och/eller de sekventiella beteckningarna som används på varje del. Datum som ska användas i det här fältet är kronologiska beteckningar som identifierar enskilda nummer med den fortsatta resursen. De sekventiella beteckningarna är vanligtvis numeriska men kan också vara alfabetiska. MARC21 - 362"}], "attributes": {"lang": "sv", "type": "default"}}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Beginning/ending date(s) of an item and/or the sequential designations used on each part. Dates to be used in this field are chronological designations that identify individual issues of the continuing resource. The sequential designations are usually numeric but can be alphabetic as well. MARC21 - 362"}], "attributes": {"lang": "en", "type": "alternative"}}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Start-/sluttdatoen for en vare og/eller de sekvensielle betegnelsene som brukes på hver del. Datoer som skal brukes i dette feltet er kronologiske betegnelser som identifiserer individuelle volumer av den fortsettende ressursen. De sekvensielle betegnelsene er vanligvis numeriske, men kan også være alfabetiske. MARC21 - 362"}], "attributes": {"lang": "no", "type": "alternative"}}]}
